      "reason": "The 1986 floors (sunrise − 2, Dhuhr, Asr, Maghrib and Isha + 2) with the safety cushion on top, against tables that print the sun's own times: sunrise up to 7 min before, Maghrib up to 6 min after, Dhuhr up to 5, Asr and Isha up to 4 (engine wave W5, safe-default-seasia.tsv).",
