      "reason": "This region's Fajr is JAKIM's 18° Subuh, the latest in South-east Asia; MUIS, Kemenag and Brunei print a 20° one, 9 to 13 min earlier (engine wave W5, safe-default-seasia.tsv).",
      "events": ["fajr"]
    },
    "entry default.safe.seasia: 15 min": {
      "reason": "The fast begins 2 min before the 20° dawn: 4 to 6 min before Kemenag's and MUIS's Fajr, and up to 14 min before JAKIM's Subuh, which it prints for its zone's latest point, rounded up (engine wave W5, safe-default-seasia.tsv).",
